WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.096
Food shopping on a low-energy day. Here is the low-effort way.

2
00:00:06.096 --> 00:00:14.448
Use the same list order as last time. Same order, same aisles, less thinking.

3
00:00:14.448 --> 00:00:22.296
Shop in the shop's quiet hour if it has one. Many shops do, early or late.

4
00:00:22.296 --> 00:00:29.760
Self-checkout means no small talk. Scan, place in the bagging area.

5
00:00:29.760 --> 00:00:37.248
If the machine says unexpected item, put the item in the bagging area and it settles.

6
00:00:37.248 --> 00:00:41.832
Pay by card, take the receipt, and go.

7
00:00:41.832 --> 00:00:49.176
Headphones are allowed in shops. Loudspeaker announcements are not our problem.

8
00:00:49.176 --> 00:00:54.456
At home, the shopping is done without us being drained.

9
00:00:54.456 --> 00:01:02.664
All done. Now you know what will happen. You can watch this again any time.

